ons?","points":"","numMode":"auto","customLabel":"","children":[{"type":"spacer","id":"e983b6bda","height":25}]}]},{"type":"question","id":"5d697bec9","title":"","meta":"","text":"En el moment en que el semàfor canvia a verd, un cotxe accelera i assoleix una velocitat de 120 km/h al cap de 12 segons:","points":"","numMode":"auto","customLabel":"","children":[{"type":"subquestion","id":"6a4ac60c1","text":"Calcula l’acceleració del cotxe","points":"","numMode":"auto","customLabel":"","children":[{"type":"spacer","id":"3b4aa7498","height":57}]},{"type":"subquestion","id":"32afffaad","text":"Si el cotxe continua amb la mateixa acceleració, quina serà la seva velocitat als 15 segons?","points":"","numMode":"auto","customLabel":"","children":[]}]}],"origen":"material"}